Bug fix: add public pool accessors, remove unsafe type casts in network sync.

This commit modifies 3 files (+64/-32 lines), spanning 2 game entities, 1 networking.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
Add findInactiveSlot(), getBulletData(), getLine(), getGeomData(),
getMesh(), and poolSize to BulletPool and GeomPool. These expose
the minimal interface needed by network-main.ts for server-authoritative
entity sync (where spawn() cannot be used due to index mismatch).

network-main.ts now uses these public methods instead of
`as unknown as { ... }` casts to access private pool internals.
All `eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any`
suppressions are removed.
